### Create a voicemail box
POST http://localhost:8080/api/voicemail-boxes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Sotuv bo'limi",
  "greetingText": "Assalomu alaykum. Hozir hech kim javob bera olmaydi. Signaldan keyin xabaringizni qoldiring, biz sizga qayta qo'ng'iroq qilamiz.",
  "maxSeconds": 120,
  "transcribe": true
}

### New voicemails
POST http://localhost:8080/api/voicemails/list
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{ "status": "NEW" }

### Mark one as heard
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/voicemails/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{ "status": "HEARD" }

### Listen
GET http://localhost:8080/api/voicemails/1/audio
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
